      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers consistently praise how gently the team handles kittens, high-strung large dogs, and feral or community cats brought in for trap-neuter-return. Owners of nervous pets appreciate that staff calm frightened animals and escort them promptly to clean kennels."
      }
