      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report smooth surgical outcomes and quick recoveries following feline and canine sterilisation procedures on West Hatcher Road. Many owners return with multiple pets and note helpful touches such as pre-measured post-operative pain medication syringes."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Empathetic and supportive clinic team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners describe the staff at this North Mountain nonprofit clinic as patient, kind, and deeply committed to animal welfare. Only one reviewer expressed disappointment after staff declined to fit recovery collars onto their cats at discharge."
      }
    }
